<title>UK: Both Brent cargoes kept - trade.</title>
<headline>Both Brent cargoes kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Both Brent cargoes due to turn wet on Thursday were kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>A combination cargo originally due to pass through the paper chains on Wednesday but deferred to November 22-24 was kept by British Petroleum.</p>
<p>The other cargo was kept by Statoil, the traders said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
